// Signing, kept out of the generated project.
//
// The .xcodeproj is built by XcodeGen, so anything set in Xcode's Signing &
// Capabilities pane is gone after the next `xcodegen`. Put it here instead and
// it survives. A Team ID is not a secret — it is readable in any shipped app —
// so this file is tracked.
//
// Find yours: Xcode → Settings → Accounts → your team → the ID in brackets,
// or `xcrun xcodebuild -showBuildSettings | grep DEVELOPMENT_TEAM` after
// signing once by hand.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
